      "STEP 4: Extracting feature values...\n",
      "Cleaned columns: ['label', 'geometry', 'DEM', 'LULC', 'NDVI', 'RAIN', 'SLOPE', 'SOIL', 'SPI', 'TOTAL_CURVATURE', 'TWI']\n"
     ]
